// Go workspace for the ASO v2 build unit. Dependabot discovers the modules
// listed under use and keeps every go.mod/go.sum consistent in one PR.
// Keep comments out of the use block: Dependabot's parser ends the block at
// the first closing parenthesis. hack/crossplane and docs/hugo are not members.
go 1.26.0

use (
	.
	./cmd/asoctl
	./samples
	./tools/generator
	./tools/mangle-test-json
)

// Workspace mode resolves imports against the full module graph, unlike module
// mode's lazy loading. leanovate/gopter's go.mod predates graph pruning, which
// drags the pre-split google.golang.org/genproto monolith into the graph, where
// it collides with genproto/googleapis/api and /rpc. Released modules and GOWORK=off
// builds are unaffected. Pinned to the monolith version already in the graph.
replace google.golang.org/genproto => google.golang.org/genproto v0.0.0-20260128011058-8636f8732409
